Package: uqcoursegraph
Type: Package
Title: Collect and Explore University of Queensland Course Dependencies
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Peler", "Yuan", email = "peleryuan@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Collect public curriculum information, parse prerequisite expressions,
    review ambiguous requirements, and explore directed course networks. Includes
    resumable collection, source metadata, reproducible offline examples,
    graph selectors, and static visualizations. Graph reachability does not
    determine enrolment eligibility or satisfaction of degree requirements.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://page.peler.top/uq-course-graph/, https://github.com/PelerYuan/uq-course-graph
BugReports: https://github.com/PelerYuan/uq-course-graph/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: digest, dplyr, ggraph, ggplot2, grid, httr, igraph, jsonlite,
    rvest, stringr, tibble, tidygraph, tidyr, scales, utils, stats, withr
Suggests: chromote, roxygen2, testthat (>= 3.1.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
